				{
					"id": "AZ33mssmxZhsKXuqv",
					"damage": {
						"type": "burn",
						"base": "1d+2"
					},
					"usage": "Breathe Electricity",
					"defaults": [
						{
							"type": "10",
							"modifier": 4
						}
					],
					"usage_notes": "Breathe Electricity (14): The dragon breathes out a bolt of lightning, dealing thrust 1d+2 burning surge damage as large-area injury. Wearing any metal armor anywhere means having DR 1 against it, if that would be worse for the victim. Anyone wounded must make a HT roll at -1 per 2 HP of injury or be stunned, rolling against HT each turn thereafter to recover. This is a cone attack that uses rules from Area and Spreading Attacks (pp. B413-414). The cone is 1-yard wide and has a length of 5 yards (ST/5). Each use costs 2 FP. It is possible to make the cone wider by using the rules from Cones of Power (GURPS Dungeon Fantasy Monsters 4: Dragons, p. 10)."
				}
			]
		}
